# Keep the build context to what the image actually needs. Everything is
# excluded first so a new file cannot silently reach a layer.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/

# Belt and braces: never let credentials or local state into an image layer,
# even if the allowlist above widens later.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
